WEBVTT

00:26:58.583 --> 00:27:00.434
AG: But now I have probabilistic power

00:27:00.458 --> 00:27:02.684
instead of certain power,
which has less power.

00:27:02.708 --> 00:27:05.601
EP: Who has certain power?
I mean, where'd you get that idea?

00:27:05.625 --> 00:27:06.726
(Laughter)

00:27:06.750 --> 00:27:08.893
AG: Too many comic books growing up.

00:27:08.917 --> 00:27:10.934
EP: Yes, but that is developmental.

00:27:10.958 --> 00:27:14.018
It's good for latency boys at age nine.

00:27:14.042 --> 00:27:17.851
But I mean, these things
can be taken away.

00:27:17.875 --> 00:27:19.559
For I mean, every powerful guy,

00:27:19.583 --> 00:27:22.476
has had experiences
where they thought they had it all

00:27:22.500 --> 00:27:24.851
and then it can instantly disappear.

00:27:24.875 --> 00:27:27.851
I think that the opposite, I mean --

00:27:27.875 --> 00:27:29.851
AG: But wait, Esther, let me stop you --

00:27:29.875 --> 00:27:32.184
EP: You can do a lot of things
to earn my trust,